"*image courtesy of* `AerialVision <https://www.aerial-vision.com.au>`__"
msgstr "*图片由* `AerialVision <https://www.aerial-vision.com.au>`__ *提供*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:19
#: 03c517c9a6114bc68c2eab4f8f7dff6e 3956f2b0908b49d5bc38c6353a67244b
#: 7f82c8f34b02461ba8890f788f04ea3f 9fe27f3e7f1243a49c558c06fd634cd5
#: f7cf4c9c164f41a3bf337dfcbad7fbef
msgid ""
"Each compass would have its raw x/y/z field readings logged by the MAGH "
"message."
msgstr "每个罗盘的原始 x/y/z 磁场读数将由 MAGH 消息记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:21
#: 7a2254d541b24a61a332b54708c672ac 8c6a34f0d0e443c690a1815335cd702c
#: a8bc7f70ac304ea6af7d42e82f2d1e0e e9ffa37ed81d4c28865a8c4bb19f16a9
#: f27b4a06ad054256ba63b49f36e1661e
msgid ""
"This capability is not included by default and would have to be included in "
"a custom build for the autopilot using the `Custom Firmware Build Server "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ and enabling the \"DroneCAN HiRes "
"compasses for survey logging\" option under **Compass**."
msgstr ""
"此功能默认不包含，需要使用 `自定义固件构建服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ 构建自定义固件，并在 "
"**Compass** 下启用 「DroneCAN HiRes compasses for survey logging」 选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:23
#: 260c75c126af4a77a1bd749a175c3197 937c93bca9f94de481939cec5c3f0c99
#: b438b93b87a0415fbe8a300e0336dac5 c9cbe539cb9c44a4b8f334ba3529dc8b
#: e3aa98cbaeef462d8385c59fce3428a8
msgid ""
"The autopilot would need to have :ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` parameter"
" set to log as soon as power is supplied."
msgstr "飞控需要将 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` 参数设置为在接通电源时立即开始记录日志。"
